<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="reference_publish_limits" xml:lang="zh-CN">
  <title>发布并发与资源上限</title>
  <refbody>
    <section>
      <title>单容器默认限制</title>
      <table frame="all" rowheader="firstcol" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="limits">
        <title>DITA-OT 发布资源对照</title>
        <tgroup cols="4">
          <colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" colwidth="1.2*"/>
          <colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colname="c3" colnum="3" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colname="c4" colnum="4" colwidth="2*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry>任务</entry>
              <entry>并发</entry>
              <entry>内存</entry>
              <entry>说明</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">HTML5 发布</entry>
              <entry>2</entry>
              <entry>512 MB</entry>
              <entry>输出到 <filepath>/data/publishes</filepath></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">PDF 发布</entry>
              <entry>1</entry>
              <entry>1 GB</entry>
              <entry>含 Noto CJK 字体映射与 PDF 渲染</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>严格校验</entry>
              <entry morerows="1">1</entry>
              <entry morerows="1">256 MB</entry>
              <entry>仅解析 DTD / RNG，不生成输出</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>队列</entry>
              <entry>SQLite 持久化，进程重启后自动续跑</entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>调优建议</title>
      <ul>
        <li>把 <codeph>DITA_PUBLISH_CONCURRENCY</codeph> 设为 CPU 核数的一半，避免 Java 堆争抢。</li>
        <li>PDF 发布优先保障内存，HTML5 可以并行。</li>
        <li>通过 <codeph>DITA_OT_HOME</codeph> 指向自定义 DITA-OT 安装时，务必执行 <codeph>dita install</codeph> 校验插件。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
